#39801
Drakyri Isle~
The air seems strangely silent here, devoid even of birdsong.  Tall trees frame
a clearing that begins here and leads to the east, their leaves motionless in
the still air.  In the center of the clearing rests a circular pool of clear
water. A narrow path leads through the clearing. A plaque, barely visible, buried
within the grass catches your eye. As you glance behind, you are startled to
see the shore and the lake have disappeared! Instead, the wall of trees has
closed off the way back to the lake.
~
